      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生野狄杜斯很庆幸朋友没有在参赛前病倒。\n而感受到她这份体贴的待兼诗歌剧……\n也准备站上“安田纪念”的舞台！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eee2675b5013f2f7ee790a5a07a1a57702943ad4c8f4d6f44196b5ac36a63ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
