      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧也不再像经典级时只在旁边看，\n而是抬头挺胸地走到地下道正中央，\n表示“我也会参赛！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "606b50fb3b48f7971944b01d0f15ad7b681b7fb002f0d6cc44383141352ca220",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
