      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧没被闪耀系列赛的气氛震慑到，\n而是很乐在其中地\n笑着结束了这场出道战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ad91e88c790ab3e52bd7acd03b1568903c052d043d1f844fd0335ef82ad5cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
