      "source_text": "并决定先以“在GⅠ竞赛跑进前五名”\n作为短期内增进自身实力的目标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e54ee9d162d4b4df88c7e2e46e13103058bec7be110bbdffb76908b1a38517d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
